{"translation":{"id":"kan_okcv","name":"Biblica® ಉಚಿತ ಕನ್ನಡ ಸಮಕಾಲಿಕ ಭಾಷಾಂತರ","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=kanokcv","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=kanokcv","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"OKCV","englishName":"Kanada Open Contemporary Version Bible","language":"kan","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"579eda1a2f0787e978bfdd1e238e1f22be5be659c98add6930ad2d796778f705","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/kan_okcv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31090,"languageName":"ಕನ್ನಡ","languageEnglishName":"Kannada"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"kan_okcv","name":"ಕೀರ್ತನೆಗಳು","commonName":"ಕೀರ್ತನೆಗಳು","title":"ಕೀರ್ತನೆಗಳು","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"8fda6557d2590d4e512d2801111ece4ef0438ce426c3b9b41fc862a02e5e2271","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/kan_okcv/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/kan_okcv/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2461},"chapter":{"number":120,"content":[{"type":"hebrew_subtitle","content":["ಯಾತ್ರಾ ಗೀತೆ."]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"ನನ್ನ ಇಕ್ಕಟ್ಟಿನಲ್ಲಿ ನಾನು ಯೆಹೋವ ದೇವರಿಗೆ ಕೂಗಿದೆನು;","poem":1},{"text":"ಅವರು ನನಗೆ ಉತ್ತರಕೊಟ್ಟರು.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"text":"ಯೆಹೋವ ದೇವರೇ, ನನ್ನ ಪ್ರಾಣವನ್ನು","poem":1},{"text":"ಸುಳ್ಳು ತುಟಿಯಿಂದಲೂ,","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ಮೋಸದ ನಾಲಿಗೆಯಿಂದಲೂ ಬಿಡಿಸಿರಿ.","poem":2}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"text":"ಮೋಸದ ನಾಲಿಗೆಯೇ,","poem":1},{"text":"ದೇವರು ನಿನಗೆ ಏನು ಕೊಡಬೇಕು?","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ಯಾವ ಹೆಚ್ಚಿನ ಶಿಕ್ಷೆಯನ್ನು ಒದಗಿಸಬೇಕು?","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"ಪರಾಕ್ರಮಶಾಲಿಯ ಹದವಾದ ಬಾಣಗಳು","poem":1},{"text":"ಮತ್ತು ಜಾಲಿ ಮರದ ಕೆಂಡಗಳಿಂದ ನಿನಗೆ ಶಿಕ್ಷೆಯಾಗುವುದು.","poem":2}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"ಅಯ್ಯೋ, ನಾನು ಮೆಷೆಕಿನಲ್ಲಿ ತಂಗಬೇಕಲ್ಲಾ!","poem":1},{"text":"ಕೇದಾರಿನ ಗುಡಾರಗಳ ಬಳಿ ವಾಸಮಾಡುತ್ತೇನೆ.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"ನಾನು ಸಮಾಧಾನವನ್ನು ವಿರೋಧಿಸುವವರ","poem":1},{"text":"ಮಧ್ಯದಲ್ಲಿ ಬಹುಕಾಲ ಜೀವಿಸಬೇಕಾಯಿತು.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"ನಾನು ಶಾಂತಿ ಪ್ರಿಯನು;","poem":1},{"text":"ಆದರೆ ನಾನು ಮಾತಾಡಿದರೆ ಅವರು ಯುದ್ಧಕ್ಕೆ ಬರುತ್ತಾರೆ.","poem":2}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/kan_okcv/PSA/120.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/kan_okcv/PSA/121.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/kan_okcv/PSA/119.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":7}